h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px; } ul { margin: 4px 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; } li { margin-bottom: 3px; }
</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 638)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Past Reviews reopen.</b> Double-click a review, or press Open Session, and its session comes back and its room is hosted again if the share is still live. A review shared from a session you never saved now keeps a snapshot, so it can always be reopened. Pasting your own review link does the same instead of joining your own room as a guest.</li>
<li><b>Session bundles open as sessions.</b> Opening a bundle folder, by double-click, drag, or File &#9656; Open, loads the session inside it rather than its media as loose clips.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
